%% Owner: docs/14-api-and-streaming.md — one POST /query/stream, measured timings with the fake LLM.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(255,255,255) User / IO
        participant C as Client (curl / Streamlit)
    end
    box rgb(243,232,255) API + generation
        participant A as FastAPI /query/stream
        participant L as LLM (Gemini · Chat Completions)
    end
    box rgb(220,252,231) Retrieval
        participant R as Retriever (hybrid + rerank)
    end
    box rgb(229,231,235) Storage
        participant P as Postgres
    end
    C->>A: POST /query/stream {question, companies?, fiscal_years?, k?}
    Note over A: checks: body valid (422) ·<br/>LLM configured (503) · companies known (422)<br/>→ JSON errors, before any event
    A->>R: search(question, k=10, filters)
    R->>P: HNSW + GIN queries
    P-->>R: 2 × 50 ranked rows
    R-->>A: 10 hits after RRF + cross-encoder (~110 ms)
    Note over A: DB connection released here
    A-->>C: 200 text/event-stream · event: sources (≈100 ms)
    A->>L: chat.completions (stream) · system + user message
    loop each token group
        L-->>A: chunk: delta.content
        Note over A: refusal gate: hold text that<br/>could still be INSUFFICIENT_CONTEXT
        A-->>C: event: delta "Net revenue for 2022 …"
    end
    L-->>A: final chunk (finish_reason, usage)
    A->>P: cache put (own short connection)
    A-->>C: event: answer {citations, usage, timings}
    Note over C,A: failure after the 200 → event: error {code, status}
